                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A living creature moves adjacent to the mold or the mold is included in the area of a vitality effect</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The mold releases a burst of spores in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10]. Any creature in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:32|options:area-effect,damaging-effect,inflicts:frightened,inflicts:confused] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[4d12[void]|options:area-damage] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[8d12[void],2d12[persistent,void]|options:area-damage] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused] for as long as it remains frightened.</p>"
                },
